# vectors-champ.bin is a table of another module's embed() outputs (the MIT Telegraph
# baseline). Nothing in the tree reads it and it is not our trained data, so it is not
# published. worklogs/LEDGER.md 2026-08-18 documents how it was produced and
# reference/distill regenerates it. See NOTICE.
module/src/vectors-champ.bin

